Hi Accounting Agape,

Corrections - Ticket Closed

TPIssues.medanswering.com is not used for trip corrections.
Instead, you must enter a correction through your MAS portal.

If you cannot enter a correction through the portal, email TripInvResolution@medanswering.com. In that email, explain that you are not able to enter a correction through the MAS TP Portal.
This ticket is being closed and no further action will be taken. Email replies will not be monitored.




